From 4a0f0d2f4cb98050fea511fdf95a7180227bce96 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 18:19:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Statistics of the generic-parallel material properties,
 result of the evaluations

The functions generated by the generic-parallel interface for material
properties report the number of points where the evaluation failed and
the first of them, as the behaviours (copies of the mfront_gpmp_Statistics
and mfront_gpmp_OutputStatus structures of TFEL). The execution options
give the statistics of an asynchronous evaluation, and the number of
statuses is no longer loaded.

The evaluate functions return a MaterialPropertyEvaluationResult (status,
bounds status, index of the first point where the evaluation failed,
error message), the same for both interfaces, as BehaviourIntegrationResult
for the behaviours.
